<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja" data-toybaco-theme="system">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>お申し込みを続けられません | トイバコ</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= Toybaco::BrandInjector.asset_path('toybaco-brand.css') %>">
<style>
:root{--navy:var(--toybaco-heading);--coral:var(--toybaco-coral);--base:var(--toybaco-offwhite);--paper:var(--toybaco-card);--ink:var(--toybaco-ink);--muted:var(--toybaco-muted);--line:var(--toybaco-hairline)}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:"Hiragino Sans","Noto Sans JP",sans-serif;background:var(--base);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;padding:48px 24px}
.wrap{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto}
h1{font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:10px}
p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:22px}
.card{background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 24px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--toybaco-button);color:var(--toybaco-on-button);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 26px}
.btn:hover{opacity:.88}
.alt{display:inline-block;margin-left:12px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700}
.help{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:14px}.help a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="card">
    <h1>お申し込みを続けられません</h1>
    <p><%= @message %></p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://toybaco.jp/pricing/">料金ページへ戻る</a>
    <a class="alt" href="https://toybaco.jp/signup/">申し込みページへ</a>
    <p class="help">解決しない場合は、<a href="https://toybaco.jp/contact/">お問い合わせフォーム</a>からご連絡ください。</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
